Fork point and current pin
--------------------------
Fork point: version 0.11.3, published 2026-09-13.
Current pin: version 0.12.0, published 2026-09-15.

The `lib/`, `bin/`, `index.mjs`, `convert.mjs`, `export.mjs` and
`cordis.patch.yml` trees are derived from that project. Their MIT licence and
